    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like the world moved on and forgot to leave a note for me. everything is so fast now, so loud and digital... i don't recognize anything anymore. i feel like a ghost just walking through a life that doesnt belong to me.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
